@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<h1>Hello, world!</h1>

<p>Welcome to <strong>BlazorVanilla on IC</strong> — the stock <code>dotnet new blazor</code> template
running entirely inside an Internet Computer canister, served by Wasp's
<code>Wasp.AspNetCore.Blazor.Server</code> middleware.</p>

<p>Use the sidebar to navigate. Each page exercises a specific corner of the Razor
component surface: routing, lifecycle hooks, cascading values, forms, JS interop, and
multiple interactive components on a single page.</p>
